// The invariants of `gopp fmt` (see roundtrip.test) on the sema test inputs
// that are valid programs, in two tests (this one and roundtrip-rules.test):
// the corpus grew past the 2 s limit of one test. This one has the top-level
// tests and the .gopp inputs of Inputs and conformance.
// RUN: %python %S/check-corpus.py %gopp --ext .test --min 15 %S/../sema/*.test %S/../sema/Inputs %S/../sema/conformance
